{"abstract":[{"text":"A cancel element indicates that the old key signature should be canceled before the new one appears. This","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"will always happen when changing to C major or A minor and need not be specified then. The cancel value","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"matches the fifths value of the canceled key signature (e.g., a cancel of -2 will provide an explicit","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"cancellation for changing from B flat major to F major). The optional location attribute indicates where the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"cancellation appears relative to the new key signature.","type":"text"}],"sections":[],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MXLCancel","kind":"identifier"}],"platforms":["macOS"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Overview","anchor":"overview","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Maps the MusicXML "},{"code":"<cancel>","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" element."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"kind":"symbol","schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"topicSections":[{"generated":true,"anchor":"Initializers","title":"Initializers","identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLCancel\/init(value:location:)"]},{"generated":true,"anchor":"Instance-Properties","title":"Instance Properties","identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLCancel\/location-swift.property","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLCancel\/value"]},{"generated":true,"anchor":"Enumerations","title":"Enumerations","identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLCancel\/Location-swift.enum"]},{"generated":true,"anchor":"Default-Implementations","title":"Default Implementations","identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLCan